flowchart TB
  subgraph Ward[Hospital wards]
    WardPC[Ward PC / Java alert sender]
    Assets[Biomedical equipment register]
  end
  subgraph Workshop[Biomedical engineering workshop]
    Receiver[Java TCP alert receiver]
    Inbox[(Durable JSONL alert inbox)]
    Desktop[VB.NET WinForms operations client]
    Access[(Microsoft Access database)]
  end
  subgraph Exec[Executive users]
    Browser[HTML frameset portal]
    Snapshot[(Published portal snapshot)]
  end
  WardPC -->|JSON alert over TCP| Receiver
  Receiver -->|append + fsync| Inbox
  Receiver -->|RECEIVED / REJECTED| WardPC
  Inbox -->|controlled import| Desktop
  Desktop <-->|OleDb| Access
  Desktop -->|publish aggregate snapshot| Snapshot
  Browser --> Snapshot
  Assets --> Desktop
